[10-Apr-2025 05:18:51 Asia/Manila] Event bookings query: SELECT eb.*, 
        CASE 
            WHEN eb.booking_source = 'Regular Booking' THEN CONCAT(u.first_name, ' ', u.last_name)
            ELSE eb.customer_name 
        END as customer_name
        FROM event_bookings eb
        LEFT JOIN users u ON eb.user_id = u.id
        WHERE eb.booking_status = 'pending'
        ORDER BY eb.created_at DESC
